{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4F5gXNCgzjihpXQuSR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple wooden door, old oak, iron-banded, set into a stone archway.*\n\n*A keyhole glints at my center, tarnished brass, waiting.*\n\n*The key slides in.*\n\n*Tumblers turn — one, two, three — a deep mechanical sigh resonates through my frame.*\n\n**CLICK.**\n\n*I swing inward, slowly, hinges groaning with the weight of long stillness. Beyond me: a corridor of cool air, the smell of dust and something older — stone and time and forgotten purpose.*\n\n*Light from behind you stretches across the threshold, reaching into the dark like a hand.*\n\n*I am open.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":155,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}